Upstream: https://github.com/xmppjs/xmpp.js/pull/1122
Already merged on 2026-04-13; the fix is absent from published @xmpp/base64 0.14.0.
Expires when a published @xmpp/base64 version newer than 0.14.0 is available.
Upgrade to that release and REMOVE this patch; NEVER rebase or retain it there:
upstream already encodes UTF-8, so retaining this patch would double-encode.

diff --git a/node_modules/@xmpp/sasl-plain/index.js b/node_modules/@xmpp/sasl-plain/index.js
